  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Implementation of the &#x201C;Early Reintegration Model in Productive Environments&#x201D; with former FARC-EP members in Colombia - Phase VI</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective of the project is to contribute to the reincorporation process of former Revolutionary Armed Forces (FARC- EP in Spanish) members through the implementation of the productive environments model (MEP) in the agricultural, agro-industrial, or services sectors in Colombia. The project will benefit 200 former combatants currently engaged in the reincorporation process. To this purpose, the project&apos;s activities will focus on strengthening the participant&apos;s abilities, capacities, and skills to ensure long-term economic sustainability. The location will be defined based on a survey conducted by the Agency of Reincorporation and Normalization that contributes to determining the interest of the population in the proposed training programs.</narrative>
  </description>
